{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["The sense of <b>Sanctify to Me</b> is that they are to sanctify them immediately, so that the commandment will be practiced in the wilderness. And the section added many commandments: that they should remember the day and the month, which is to be spring; and that they should keep this statute in its appointed time — and this is an allusion to the intercalation of the year, for the Passover may be performed only in the month of spring. And it added concerning leavened matter, 'No se'or shall be seen in all your territory,' and the commandment of the totafot."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:07:23.334186485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}